      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "עד לשמים הגיע",
      "rationale": "Ḥdad tamyurt taɛbranit 'tewweḍ armad igenwan' — tazra-nsen terkeb ar igenni, amzun d tiṭ teɛnan tikli."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "teẓda \/ tazra",
      "rationale": "חמה (aṭas n weṣud) d זעף (tazra) sin n wawalen n teɛbranit i yemgerraden cwiṭ; taqbaylit tesɛa kan yiwet n tsertit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "you",
      "subject": "i weɛesker n Comeron",
      "rationale": "Navi Ɛoded isla-yen-d s talwit i yiserdasen n Yisrael i d-yewwin ayt Yehuda d tjinin."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Din yella yiwen n navi n Yahwe, Ɛoded isem-is; yeffeɣ ɣer zdat n weɛesker i d-ikecmen ɣer Comeron, yenna-yasen: Wali, seg teẓda n Yahwe, Elohim n yibanen-nwen, ɣef Yehuda, yerra-ten deg yifassen-nwen, tessenvet degsen s tazra, arma d igenwan teṭṭef.",
